{"slug":"j-h-r","ar":"ج ه ر","total":16,"core":"openness; loudness","forms":[{"ar":"جَهْر","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":7,"gloss":"speaking aloud; openness","word":null,"ex":{"s":21,"a":110,"p":3,"ar":["إِنَّهُۥ","يَعْلَمُ","ٱلْجَهْرَ","مِنَ","ٱلْقَوْلِ","وَيَعْلَمُ","مَا","تَكْتُمُونَ"],"en":"Indeed, He knows what is declared of speech, and He knows what you conceal"}},{"ar":"جَهَرَ","kind":"verb","form":1,"count":5,"gloss":"to speak aloud, publicize","word":null,"ex":{"s":20,"a":7,"p":2,"ar":["وَإِن","تَجْهَرْ","بِٱلْقَوْلِ","فَإِنَّهُۥ","يَعْلَمُ","ٱلسِّرَّ","وَأَخْفَى"],"en":"And if you speak aloud - then indeed, He knows the secret and what is [even] more hidden"}},{"ar":"جَهْرَة","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":3,"gloss":"openly, manifestly","word":null,"ex":{"s":2,"a":55,"p":10,"ar":["وَإِذْ","قُلْتُمْ","يَـٰمُوسَىٰ","لَن","نُّؤْمِنَ","لَكَ","حَتَّىٰ","نَرَى","ٱللَّهَ","جَهْرَةً","فَأَخَذَتْكُمُ","ٱلصَّـٰعِقَةُ","وَأَنتُمْ","تَنظُرُونَ"],"en":"And [recall] when you said, \"O Moses, we will never believe you until we see Allah outright\"; so the thunderbolt took you while you were looking on"}},{"ar":"جِهَار","kind":"noun","form":null,"count":1,"gloss":"publicly, openly","word":null,"ex":{"s":71,"a":8,"p":4,"ar":["ثُمَّ","إِنِّى","دَعَوْتُهُمْ","جِهَارًا"],"en":"Then I invited them publicly"}}],"surahs":[[4,2],[6,2],[49,2],[2,1],[7,1],[13,1],[16,1],[17,1],[20,1],[21,1],[67,1],[71,1],[87,1]]}